iox-cpp provides CMake targets:

    find_package(iox CONFIG REQUIRED)

    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE
        iox::core
        iox::xtf
    )

Other targets are available as needed:

    iox::json
    iox::xml
    iox::factory
    iox::abi

Install feature `ilic` to also provide the model-aware target:

    iox::ilic
